---
import Shot from "./Shot.astro";
---
<section class="sec" id="private" aria-labelledby="h-private">
  <div class="wrap center head">
    <p class="eyebrow o" data-rv>Private brain</p>
    <h2 class="h-l" id="h-private" data-rv>It stays home.</h2>
    <p class="lede" data-rv="2">Skovern's brain lives right on your computer. Ask about prices, late orders, or that grumpy review. Your words stay put.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wide">
    <div class="win" id="f-win">
      <Shot name="app-chat" alt="Skovern's Chat page, writing autumn wreath captions for a flower shop" />
      <div class="bchip" id="f-chip"><span class="socket"><img class="still" src="/img/icon-front.webp" alt="" width="512" height="512" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="bc-t"><b>On this computer</b><span>Your brain · awake</span></span></div>
      <span class="dock-note">Your brain lives here</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="facts">
    <div data-rv><h3>Your words stay put.</h3><p>Chats with your brain don't leave this computer. Nobody on the other end is reading along.</p></div>
    <div data-rv="2"><h3>Cloud is your call.</h3><p>Want a bigger brain in the cloud? You can pick one. Skovern only uses it if you say so.</p></div>
    <div data-rv="3"><h3>Nothing sneaks out.</h3><p>A few things do go online, like update checks. Each one gets written down. More on that next.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
